  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slice the chicken thinly.</li><li>Slice the greens’ <b>stems thinly</b> and keep the leaves separate.</li><li>Chop the garlic and crack the egg into a cup.</li><li>Mix the sauce:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>oyster sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>regular soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tsp</span></span></li><li>dark soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>rice vinegar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>sugar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Prep everything",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
